t\n-  Qualify for bilateral implantation within 1 month\n-  No previous refractive or ocular surgery\n-  Available IOL dioptre range: 18 to 27D\n-  Expected postoperative astigmatism ≤ 0.75D\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- > 50 years old",\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "years"\n                      ],\n                      "Age": [\n                        "old"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "50"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "> 50 years"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        ">"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Bilateral age-related cataract",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "cataract"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "cataract"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "Bilateral age-related"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Qualify for bilateral implantation within 1 month",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "bilateral implantation"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "bilateral implantation"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "within"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "month"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-