lective coronary surgery.\n-  Patient in sinusal rhythm before the operation and during the collection of hemodynamic data.\n-  Patients with conserved left ventricular function (based on left ventricular ejection fraction assessed by preoperative echocardiography and superior to 50%)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patient of the CHU Brugmann Hospital receiving elective coronary surgery.",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "coronary surgery"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "coronary surgery"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "receiving"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "receiving"\n          ],\n          "Location": [\n            "CHU Brugmann Hospital"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "to"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "1"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "elective"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patient in sinusal rhythm before the operation",\n              "Condition": [\n                "sinusal rhythm"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "sinusal rhythm"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "operation"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "operation"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and during the collection of hemodynamic data.",\n              "Observation": [\n                "hemodynamic data"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "hemodynamic data"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with conserved left ventricular function (based on left ventricular ejection fraction assessed by preoperat