e absence of a history of HFpEF or HFrEF, pulmonary, neurologic, orthopedic, or other diseases affecting the neuromuscular system.\n- Controls will be matched for age and sex.\n- All HFpEF patients will be managed by their primary care physician or cardiologist with additional review and oversight by Dr. Borlaug (Co-Investigator) prior to enrollment to ensure adequacy of inclusion and exclusion criteria and that participation in exercise testing and resistance exercise training is safe.\n- Clinical diagnosis of HFpEF.\n- Patients with a history stable (no medication changes in past 6 weeks (w/duration of diagnosis >6 months).\n- New York Heart Association class I-III.\n- Current non-smokers with <15 pack year history.\n- Non-pregnant women, and individuals who are able to exercise (i.e. without orthopedic limitations or neuromuscular disorders).\n\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "AND": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "AND": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "AND": {\n                                                        "left": {\n                                                          "AND": {\n                                                            "left": {\n                                                              "AND": {\n                                                                "left": {\n                                                                  "AND": {\n                                                                    "left": {\n                                                                      "AND": {\n                                                                        "left": {\n                                                                          "AND": {\n                                                                            "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Healthy subjects: Adults (≥21 years of age) in the absence of a history of HFpEF",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "HFpEF",\n                            "Healthy"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "HFpEF",\n                            "Healthy"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "≥"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "years"\n                          ],\n                          "Age": [\n                            "age"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "21"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "≥21 years"\n                          ],\n                          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                            "Adults"\n                          ],\n                          "Negation": [\n                            "absence"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "history"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "HFpEF"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or HFrEF, pulmonary,",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "HFrEF"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "HFrEF"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "pulmonary"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "neurologic,",\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "neurologic"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "orthopedic, or other diseases affecting the neuromuscular system.",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "diseases"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "neuromuscular",\n                            "orthopedic"\n                          ],\n                          "Other": [\n                            "other"\n                          ],\n                          "Stability": [\n                            "affecting"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "diseases"\n                          ],\n                          "Assertion": [\n                            "affecting"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Controls will be matched for age and sex."\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- All HFpEF patients will be managed by their primary care physician or cardiologist with additional review and oversight by Dr. Borlaug (Co-Investigator) prior to enrollment to ensure adequacy of inclusion and exclusion criteria and that participation in exercise testing and resistance exercise training is safe.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "HFpEF"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "HFpEF"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "exercise"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "exercise testing",\n                "resistance exercise training"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "exercise testing",\n                "resistance exercise training"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "safe"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "enrollment"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Clinical diagnosis of HFpEF.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "HFpEF"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "HFpEF"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "HFpEF"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with a history stable (no medication changes in past 6 weeks (w/duration of diagnosis >6 months)).",\n      "Condition": [\n        "diagnosis"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "diagnosis"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        ">",\n        "w"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "weeks",\n        "months"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "6"\n   