details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\nA. Histologically proven breast cancer confirmed by biopsy or pathological examination of the resected tumor.\nB. Histologically confirmed breast cancer patients, fulfilling any of the following:\n1. Multiple bone metastases indicated by bone scan\n2. Bone scan positive, and proven by other imaging examinations, including computed tomography (CT), magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) and X-ray.\n3. Bone scan positive, with clinical symptoms, including bone pain, pathologic fracture, spinal cord compression and so on.\n4. Bone metastases indicated by PET-CT\n5. Histologically proven bone metastases\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "AND": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "AND": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                                      "AND": {\n                                                        "left": {\n                                                          "AND": {\n                                                            "left": {\n                                                              "AND": {\n                                                                "left": {\n                                                                  "AND": {\n                                                                    "left": {\n                                                                      "AND": {\n                                                                        "left": {\n                                                                          "AND": {\n                                                                            "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "A. Histologically proven breast cancer confirmed by biopsy",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "biopsy"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "biopsy"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "breast"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "to"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or pathological examination of the resected tumor.",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "pathological examination",\n                            "resected"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "pathological examination",\n                            "resected"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "tumor"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "tumor"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "resected"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "B. Histologically confirmed breast cancer patients, fulfilling any of the following:"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. Multiple bone metastases indicated by bone scan",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cancer",\n                    "metastases"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "cancer",\n                    "metastases"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "bone scan"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "bone scan"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "bone"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "to"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Multiple"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "Multiple"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "indicated"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "indicated"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "indicated"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2. Bone scan positive, and proven by other imaging examinations, including computed tomography (CT), magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) and X-ray.",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "Bone scan",\n                "computed tomography",\n                "CT",\n                "magnetic resonance imaging",\n                "MRI",\n                "X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "Bone scan",\n                "computed tomography",\n                "CT",\n                "magnetic resonance imaging",\n                "MRI",\n                "X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "bone"\n              ],\n              "Other": [\n                "other"\n              ],\n              "Polarity": [\n                "positive"\n              ],\n              "Imaging": [\n                "imaging"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "3. Bone scan positive, with clinical symptoms, including bone pain, pathologic fracture, spinal cord compression and so on.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "bone pain",\n            "pathologic fracture",\n            "spinal cord compression"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "bone pain",\n            "pathologic fracture",\n            "spinal cord compression"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "Bone scan"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "Bone scan"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "bone"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "symptoms"\n          ],\n          "Polarity": [\n            "positive"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "4. Bone metastases indicated by PET-CT",\n      "Condition": [\n        "metastases"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "metastases"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "PET-CT"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "PET-CT"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "bone"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "indicated"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "indicated"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "indicated"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
