o 30 days of age\n-  24 hours post congenital heart surgery\n-  Receiving mechanical ventilation\n-  Background noise level (at bedside) at the time of music therapy must be 55dB or less.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Greater than 37 weeks gestation,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "gestation"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "gestation"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "weeks"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "37"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Greater than 37 weeks"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "Greater than"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Between 0 to 30 days of age",\n                  "Age": [\n                    "age"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "days"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "0",\n                    "30"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Between 0 to 30 days"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "Between",\n                    "to"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- 24 hours post congenital heart surgery",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "congenital heart surgery"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "congenital heart surgery"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "hours"\n        