cally recurrent or metastatic, hormone-receptor positive, HER2 negative Breast Cancer.\n2. Age: 18 - 75 years old, postmenopausal women or prepostmenopausal women\n3. Received prior endocrine therapy\n4. One previous line of chemotherapy for advanced/metastatic disease is allowed in addition to endocrine therapy.\n5. Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group [ECOG] 0-1\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "1. Has the pathologically-confirmed diagnosis of locally recurrent",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "locally recurrent"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or metastatic, hormone-receptor positive, HER2 negative Breast Cancer.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Breast Cancer",\n                        "Cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Breast Cancer",\n                        "Cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "metastatic",\n                        "hormone-receptor positive",\n                        "HER2 negative"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "2. Age: 18 - 75 years old, postmenopausal women",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "postmenopausal"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "postmenopausal"\n                      ],\n                      "Age": [\n                        "Age"\n                      ],\