artburn for 3 months or more during prior to randomization visit.\n3. Episode of heartburn for 2 days or more during the last 7 days prior to randomization visit.\n4. Grade N, M by EGD test.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. Male",\n                  "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                    "Male"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or Female aged ≥ 19 years",\n                  "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                    "Male",\n                    "Female"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "years"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "aged"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "19"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "≥ 19 years"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "≥"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2. Episode of heartburn for 3 months or more during prior to randomization visit.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "heartburn"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "heartburn"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "3"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "3 months or more"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "or more"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "randomization"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "for"\n              ]\n            }\n          }